    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n84622" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολῠ-άρᾱτος</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰρ</span>], 
			Ep.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολῠ-άρητος</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾱ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀράομαι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>much-wished-for, much-desired,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἤ τίς οἱ εὐξαμένῃ π. θεὸς ἦλθεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					6.280
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				19.404
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Cer.</u>
				220
			</span></i>: in 
				Att.
			 Prose, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν πολυάρατον σοφίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Tht.</u>
					165e
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>cursed,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολακεία, γόητες,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Isid.</u>
				18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				92
			</span></i>.</div>
